4. Opening clips. For w01 to w07, the words of the five day lines equal the keys of `opening.wordClips` at HEAD and after the change.

5. Audio files. The 5 copy sources exist and their targets do not exist yet. The 5 removal targets exist today, and no week map names them after the change. No new audio and no MiniMax call.

6. w08 audio. The new `opening.pa.2` keeps the same sound labels, so `opening.audio[2]` needs no change.

