8. Check rows. Each row has an exact id, signature, label, and ordered detail parts. Red needs no choice.

9. Schema and receiver. `FocusSchema` sits at `dashboard/lib/storytime/schema.ts:102`, and the module holds no passthrough call. Monorepo alone can confirm its own `focusSchema` and its empty audio list. w08 has no `focus.element` key, and R14-2 does not say what the new-sound part does then (finding F1).

10. Plan. Each task has a falsifiable Done-when and a named gate. The heavy-run rule, the Thai rule, the Red and Green families, and the dates are pinned. The Green commit comes before the Phase 13 Clips task.

11. Print plan sub-line. It agrees with P14-D12, Q14-6, and the change list.

12. Approval. P14-D11 makes no false approval and keeps w01 published.

